{"problem_id": "45bef38b-0bf5-4773-ab53-221633fbb78a", "transformations": {"schema_version": 3, "revision": 9, "items": [{"at": "2026-08-27T10:10:49.949490+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "assets"}, "value": {"alt": "", "url": "/assets/0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8", "html": "<img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8\"/>", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8", "position": 0, "asset_key": "image_1", "parent_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:47.658776+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/> На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции вида <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{ax+b}{x+c}\"></span> ,  где числа <i>a</i>, <i>b</i> и <i>c</i>  — целые. Най­ди­те  <i>a</i>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"]}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:47.658776+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "value": {"html": "<section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Решение\"><p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем дан­ную функ­цию:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{ax+b}{x+c}=\\frac{ax+ac+b-ac}{x+c}=\\frac{ax+ac}{x+c}+\\frac{b-ac}{x+c}=a+\\frac{b-ac}{x+c}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <span data-inline-latex=\"y=2\"></span>, зна­чит, <span data-inline-latex=\"a=2\"></span>.</p></section><section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Альтернативное решение.\"><p>Гра­фик пред­став­ля­ет собой ги­пер­бо­лу, урав­не­ние ко­то­рой можно за­пи­сать в виде <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\frac{k}{x+p}+q\"></span>.  Вер­ти­каль­ная асимп­то­та ги­пер­бо­лы <i>x</i>  =  3, сле­до­ва­тель­но, <i>p</i>  =  −3. Го­ри­зон­таль­ная асимп­то­та ги­пер­бо­лы <i>y</i>  =  2, сле­до­ва­тель­но, <i>q</i>  =  2. Гра­фик про­хо­дит через точку с ко­ор­ди­на­та­ми (2; 1), под­ста­вив их в урав­не­ние, по­лу­чим <i>k</i>  =  1.</p><p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем по­лу­чив­ше­е­ся урав­не­ние: </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\frac{1}{x-3}+2=\\frac{1+2x-6}{x-3}=\\frac{2x-5}{x-3}\"></span> , </p></center><p>от­ку­да <i>a</i>  =  2.</p></section>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": []}, "operation": "rewrite", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:47.658776+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:47.658776+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:47.658776+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:47.658776+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:47.658776+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_5"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T15:58:47.658776+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_6"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/0f93057b-f0e3-4f5d-9e56-fccc39a1cfa8\"/> На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции вида <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{ax+b}{x+c}\"></span> ,  где числа <i>a</i>, <i>b</i> и <i>c</i>  — целые. Най­ди­те  <i>a</i>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">2</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "source", "html": "<p>Источник: <a href=\"https://analys-urok.sdamgia.ru/problem?id=4741\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">4741</a></p>", "title": "Источник", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "source:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:source:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Решение\"><p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем дан­ную функ­цию:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{ax+b}{x+c}=\\frac{ax+ac+b-ac}{x+c}=\\frac{ax+ac}{x+c}+\\frac{b-ac}{x+c}=a+\\frac{b-ac}{x+c}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <span data-inline-latex=\"y=2\"></span>, зна­чит, <span data-inline-latex=\"a=2\"></span>.</p></section><section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Альтернативное решение.\"><p>Гра­фик пред­став­ля­ет собой ги­пер­бо­лу, урав­не­ние ко­то­рой можно за­пи­сать в виде <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\frac{k}{x+p}+q\"></span>.  Вер­ти­каль­ная асимп­то­та ги­пер­бо­лы <i>x</i>  =  3, сле­до­ва­тель­но, <i>p</i>  =  −3. Го­ри­зон­таль­ная асимп­то­та ги­пер­бо­лы <i>y</i>  =  2, сле­до­ва­тель­но, <i>q</i>  =  2. Гра­фик про­хо­дит через точку с ко­ор­ди­на­та­ми (2; 1), под­ста­вив их в урав­не­ние, по­лу­чим <i>k</i>  =  1.</p><p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем по­лу­чив­ше­е­ся урав­не­ние: </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\frac{1}{x-3}+2=\\frac{1+2x-6}{x-3}=\\frac{2x-5}{x-3}\"></span> , </p></center><p>от­ку­да <i>a</i>  =  2.</p></section>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}